#. macro: <if $gn4>she's<else>he's</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if $gn4>her<else>his</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/015/HeaVna105_01584:TEXT_HEAVNA105_01584_ROTHE_000_030:1"
msgid "Hah! Now there's a <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> what looks like <if $gn4>she's<else>he's</if> found <if $gn4>her<else>his</if> marks!"
msgstr "Ха! Вот это <if $gn4>женщина<else>мужчина</if> — сразу видно, что своё дело знает!"

#. ja: <if $gn4>姉ちゃん<else>兄ちゃん</if>や、助かったぞぉ。<br>これで建物の凍結も、ちったぁマシになるだろうよぉ。<br>作業もはかどるってもんさねぇ。
#. de: Wenn wir uns ins Zeug legen, können wir den Rückstand in ein, zwei Wochen wieder aufholen. Vielen Dank, <if $gn4>Abenteurerin<else>Abenteurer</if>!
#. fr: C'est de personnes comme vous dont nous avons besoin ici<nbsp>! Grâce à vous, les travaux vont pouvoir se dérouler normalement, et je vous en remercie.
#. speaker: ROTHE
#. macro: <if $gn4>she<else>he</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/015/HeaVna105_01584:TEXT_HEAVNA105_01584_ROTHE_000_031:1"
msgid "You're just the sort we need around here─the kind that'll hop to when <if $gn4>she<else>he</if> sees a task undone!"
msgstr "Вы как раз такой человек, какой нам нужен. Увидите, что работа стоит, — сразу за неё!"
